  "title": "Pleasant Pork Chops",
  "description": "When I was a bachelor cooking for 2 other roommates this was a 'feast night' for us! We all really liked it. Pork chops simmered in a sour cream and onion sauce with spices.",
  "authors": [
    "CLYDE PATTERSON"
  ],
